<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76061" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτοι</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ
			τοι,</span></b> 
		Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>indeed not</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.298
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				515
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				759
			</span></i>, etc.: in 
				Att.
			 freq. before protestations, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτοι μὰ τὴν Δήμητρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					64
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτοι . . μὰ τὸν Ἀπόλλω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>V.</u>
					1366
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτοι μὰ τὴν Γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pax</u>
					188
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὰ τὸν Δί᾽ οὔτοι γε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὰ τὸν Δί᾽ οὐ τοίνυν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>V.</u>
					1141
				</span></i>
			 (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοίνυν</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; ἀλλ᾽ οὔτοι . . γε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					137
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτοι δή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cri.</u>
					43d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτοι δὴ . . γε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Euthphr.</u>
					2a
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτοι μὲν οὖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					271b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτοι πότε</span>
			<i>never indeed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				522
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτοι ποτέ . . γε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OT</u>
					852
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ τἄν, οὔ τἄρα.
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτοι</span> is freq.
			confounded with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτι</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
